This repository is the open-source editor + pixel-grid library for Gridsmith.
The official hosted product and API live at martialgames.net (see README).

Third-party / community notes
-----------------------------
Default drawing colors use the well-known 16-color PICO-8-style palette
(exact hex list; community-treated as CC-0). This is not an official Lexaloffle
product and is not affiliated with Lexaloffle Games.
